stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> ToDo

    ToDo: To Do<br/>no child has started<br/>often no children at all
    InProgress: In Progress<br/>children are moving<br/>weeks here is normal
    InReview: In Review<br/>every child is Done
    Done: Done<br/>no defined way in

    ToDo --> InProgress: the first child goes In Progress
    InProgress --> InReview: the last child reaches Done
    InReview --> Done: undefined — needs the QA and UAT process
    Done --> [*]

    classDef inScope fill:#0F1622,stroke:#34E0B4,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#E9F1F9
    classDef gap fill:#1A2638,stroke:#FFC53D,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#E9F1F9
    class ToDo,InProgress,InReview inScope
    class Done gap
